    "media:imagetext": "The Best of\nAlaska\nPoint\nBarrow\nKotzebue\nNome\nTour\nDestinations\nIn Alaska, \"the best\" is a set of experiences as unique as they are unforgettable. Different\nworlds of culture, color and excitement. Great natural expanses of scenic beauty. Wildlife.\nAdventure. The Arctic Realm. Eskimo people. Age-old traditions.\nPrudhoe Bay\nThis year... see the\nBest of Alaska\nCross the Arctic Circle\nSee the Midnight Sun and receive a\nbeautiful parchment (suitable for framing)\nas proof of your crossing.\nPrudhoe Bay-Arctic ecology, with a visit\nto the origin of the famous Trans-Alaskan\nPipeline.\nPoint Barrow-\"Top of the World\" -\nNorthernmost point on the North American\ncontinent. Stand on the shores of the Arctic\nOcean. Eskimo blanket toss, ceremonial\ndances, crafts, whaling capital of the Arctic.\nKotzebue / Nome-Eskimo dances, craft\ndemonstrations, and shopping\nArctic Circle\nKotzebue's famous \"Living Museum of\nthe Arctic.\" History and romance of\nthe Gold Rush days... gold\npanning in Nome.\nFairbanks\nUnique Alaska\nKatmai National\nMonument.\nMan settled here 4,000\nMt. McKinley\nyears ago. From a\nwilderness lodge,\ntake an all-day\nAnchorage\nKatmai\nguided trip to the Valley\nJunea\nof 10,000 Smokes, site of a\ncataclysmic eruption in 1912. Hiking..\nwildlife. photography.\nKodiak - Historical ... first Russian fur\ntrading settlement in North America. King Crab\nCapital of the World. Visit city, boat harbor,\nBaranof Museum, Russian Orthodox church.\nAngler's Paradise-Some of the finest trophy freshwater\nfishing in the world at a comfortable wilderness lodge.\nAlaskan fishing? This is it! Write for Angler's\nParadise brochure.\nKodiak\nKatmai National Monument\nAngler's\nParadise\nWien AIR ALASKA\nWIEN AIR ALASKA\n4100 International Airport Road\nAnchorage, Alaska 99502\n(907) 243-4100",
